Subject: Skip test on i386.

The test fails due to excess precision on that architecture, see
https://wiki.debian.org/ArchitectureSpecificsMemo#i386

On i386, the calculated value is 326.4999999999999 instead
of the expected 326.49999999999994.

Build log of the failing autopkgtest:
https://ci.debian.net/packages/f/fonttools/testing/i386/67681284/
